{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fat Cat Fest is a <strong>two player</strong> party game where you can laugh while you compete in a food contest with various minigames. <br>You can choose your favorite cat from our 4 furry friends. <br><strong>  </strong><br><br><br><strong>EAT, EAT, AND EAT TO WIN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friend to see who's faster while you enjoy typical Colombian dishes.<br>The first to finish the meals will be the winner, so be sure to have an empty stomach before you start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.poster.avif?t=1757454143\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.webm?t=1757454143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.mp4?t=1757454143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br><strong>WIN IN MINIGAMES BETWEEN MEALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in 10 different minigames that will appear randomly between meals, and whoever wins will have an advantage to get closer to victory!   <br>These minigames are frenetic and short, easy to understand but hard to dominate. You'll have to be on your toes if you want to win!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.poster.avif?t=1757454143\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.webm?t=1757454143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.mp4?t=1757454143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS ( CAT FRIENDLY )</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, anyone can eat, you only need a joystick and a button. Even our cats could handle it! We recommend playing with two different controllers, but you can use only a keyboard if you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.poster.avif?t=1757454143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.webm?t=1757454143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.mp4?t=1757454143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET THE CATS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Timmy\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Miguel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/96cf2271ae96baa73d5faa579480d2a0.avif?t=1757454143\" width=564 height=243 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 